  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ちのうが　たかく　とても　ごうかい。ハンマーで　いわを　なぐりとばしてそらとぶ　アーマーガアを　ねらう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "지능이 높고 매우 호쾌하다. 해머로 바위를 날려서 하늘을 나는 아머까오를 노린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "智商高超，性格豪邁。會用錘子打飛岩石來攻擊飛在空中的鋼鎧鴉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon très intelligent et hardi jette des rochers dans les airs puis les frappe avec son marteau en visant les Corvaillus qui volent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist intelligent und verwegen. Mit seinem Hammer schlägt es Felsen in die Luft und zielt damit auf fliegende Krarmor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee una notable inteligencia y una exacerbada personalidad. Si ve Corviknight volando, golpea y lanza rocas con su martillo para derribarlos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Possiede una notevole intelligenza e un’indole ardita. Con il suo martello scaglia rocce in aria, cercando di abbattere i Corviknight in volo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This intelligent Pokémon has a very daring disposition. It knocks rocks into the sky with its hammer, aiming for flying Corviknight.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "知能が　高く　とても　豪快。ハンマーで　岩を　殴り飛ばして空飛ぶ　アーマーガアを　狙う。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "智力高超，性格豪迈。会用锤子打飞岩石来攻击飞在空中的钢铠鸦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee una notable inteligencia y una exacerbada personalidad. Si ve Corviknight volando, golpea y lanza rocas con su martillo para derribarlos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１００キロを　こえる　ハンマーをかるがる　ふりまわして　ほしいものをうばいとり　すみかへと　もちかえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "100kg이 넘는 해머를 가볍게 휘둘러서 원하는 것을 빼앗은 다음 거처로 가지고 간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會輕鬆地揮舞著超過１００公斤的錘子來奪取想要的東西，然後帶回自己的住處。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon s’empare de tout ce qu’il convoite en maniant sans effort son marteau de plus de 100 kg et ramène son butin chez lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Granforgita schwingt den über 100 kg schweren Hammer mühelos umher. Es schleppt alles mit sich nach Hause, was ihm gefällt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Blande sin esfuerzo su pesado martillo de más de 100 kg. Cuando quiere algo, lo roba y se lo lleva de vuelta a su guarida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È capace di brandire il suo martello pesante oltre 100 kg come se niente fosse. Se vede qualcosa che gli piace, lo ruba e lo porta nella sua tana.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
